_paragraph\" >Explore caves to obtain valuable ores. But be careful! The deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get your dream home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/7e4bae9afc75a148fc11e26f691f0221.poster.avif?t=1754328745\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/7e4bae9afc75a148fc11e26f691f0221.webm?t=1754328745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/7e4bae9afc75a148fc11e26f691f0221.mp4?t=1754328745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and furnish your house, creating the home of your dreams!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seasonal Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal events last one season (28 days) and can either hinder or help the player. They affect the world the player lives in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Financial Crisis! The price of the products the player sells drops significantly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prosperous Season! During this season, the price the player can sell products for increases!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
